# Literature Search

## Goal
- Conduct a comprehensive literature search on the nueropeptide Y1 receptor between 1995 and 2026 
## Implementation
- Use MCP server
- Create a markdown file with one paragraph per paper found in the literature search.
- Each paragraph will contain the paper title, link, 1st authors, and a brief summary 
- For each paper found, validate that the paper is real and not a hallucination
- Stop after 5 minutes of processing and keep the markdown file as is